WEBVTT

00:09:27.340 --> 00:09:31.506
LF: ... a salty bitch
who hated everything

00:09:31.530 --> 00:09:35.726
and was very extreme in her opinions.

00:09:35.750 --> 00:09:39.326
AG: Usually those opinions
were trashing celebrity baby names

00:09:39.350 --> 00:09:41.994
or articles in prestigious newspapers.

00:09:42.446 --> 00:09:45.446
But the problem was,
that's how Leah treated everything,

00:09:45.470 --> 00:09:47.596
online and off.

00:09:47.620 --> 00:09:49.886
LF: During union
negotiations at my company,

00:09:49.910 --> 00:09:54.910
I left a comment on a blog post
saying, "Unions suck dick."

00:09:55.530 --> 00:09:58.886
That was something I felt
was valid to express.

00:09:58.910 --> 00:10:01.786
And you know, I just thought I was right.